# WD Marketing — Premium Starter

A production-minded Next.js starter for the new WD Marketing website.

## Stack

- Next.js 16.3.3
- React 19.2
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS 4.3
- App Router
- AVIF/WebP-ready image configuration

## Run locally

```bash
npm install
npm run dev
```

Open http://localhost:3000

## Asset structure

Place final assets here:

```text
public/
  images/
    brand/
      logo.svg
      logo-mark.svg
    hero/
    founder/
    projects/
      stone-pro/
        cover.webp
        desktop-home.webp
        mobile-home.webp
        results.webp
      roofing/
        cover.webp
        website.webp
        seo-growth.webp
        lead-results.webp
      exp-auto-parts/
        cover.webp
  videos/
  icons/
```

The current Work cards contain premium placeholders so the site runs even before the real case-study imagery is added.

